<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/T(2.1 Dataset Overview  The dataset used in this project is the Motion Sensor Driving Behaviour Dataset \(train_motion_data.csv\), which contains time-series readings from smartphone-based inertial measurement units \(IMUs\) recorded during real driving sessions. The dataset captures sensor signals from three categories of driving behaviour: AGGRESSIVE, NORMAL, and SLOW. )/E(2.1 Dataset Overview  The dataset used in this project is the Motion Sensor Driving Behaviour Dataset \(train_motion_data.csv\), which contains time-series readings from smartphone-based inertial measurement units \(IMUs\) recorded during real driving sessions. The dataset captures sensor signals from three categories of driving behaviour: AGGRESSIVE, NORMAL, and SLOW. )/K[5]/P 213 0 R/Pg 9 0 R>>
