<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(An IQR-based outlier detection was performed on all sensor features. Outliers were identified at varying rates across features, with GyroZ exhibiting the highest outlier percentage \(10.68%\) and AccX the lowest \(3.07%\). Rather than removing outliers, they were retained in the dataset as they may represent genuine extreme driving events \(e.g., emergency braking or sharp cornering\) that are important for classifying aggressive behaviour. )/E(An IQR-based outlier detection was performed on all sensor features. Outliers were identified at varying rates across features, with GyroZ exhibiting the highest outlier percentage \(10.68%\) and AccX the lowest \(3.07%\). Rather than removing outliers, they were retained in the dataset as they may represent genuine extreme driving events \(e.g., emergency braking or sharp cornering\) that are important for classifying aggressive behaviour. )/K[4]/P 470 0 R/Pg 15 0 R>>
