840 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(4.6.5 Overfitting Analysis  A systematic overfitting check was conducted by comparing training performance, test performance, and cross-validation scores. The train-test F1-Score gap of 0.0041 and the CV-test gap of \2120.0031 both indicate that the model generalises extremely well without overfitting to the training data. )/E(4.6.5 Overfitting Analysis  A systematic overfitting check was conducted by comparing training performance, test performance, and cross-validation scores. The train-test F1-Score gap of 0.0041 and the CV-test gap of \2120.0031 both indicate that the model generalises extremely well without overfitting to the training data. )/K[2]/P 838 0 R/Pg 23 0 R>>
endobj

841 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(4.7 Hyperparameter Tuning Results  GridSearchCV with 3-fold cross-validation was applied over 18 parameter combinations. The optimal hyperparameters identified were learning_rate = 0.15, max_depth = 7, and n_estimators = 150. The tuned model achieved a test accuracy of 0.9959 and an F1-Score of 0.9959, representing  a marginal improvement of 0.0041 over the baseline configuration. )/E(4.7 Hyperparameter Tuning Results  GridSearchCV with 3-fold cross-validation was applied over 18 parameter combinations. The optimal hyperparameters identified were learning_rate = 0.15, max_depth = 7, and n_estimators = 150. The tuned model achieved a test accuracy of 0.9959 and an F1-Score of 0.9959, representing  a marginal improvement of 0.0041 over the baseline configuration. )/K[3]/P 838 0 R/Pg 23 0 R>>
