<</Title(2.3 Class Distribution  The target variable is well-balanced across three classes, which is a desirable property for classification tasks as it prevents class-imbalance bias. The distribution is as follows:)/Dest[10 0 R/Fit]/Count -3/First 995 0 R/Last 997 0 R/Parent 993 0 R/Next 1001 0 R>>
endobj

